  "transcript": [
    {
      "s": 36.9,
      "e": 41.02,
      "text": "We are now in the city of the country, and we are here to see the city."
    },
    {
      "s": 286.68,
      "e": 288.88,
      "text": "The helicopter pilot with the Italian Air Force."
    },
    {
      "s": 288.88,
      "e": 293.4,
      "text": "Here in Trapani, we are at the 82nd of the squadron,"
    },
    {
      "s": 293.4,
      "e": 296.28,
      "text": "and our duty is to save human lives."
    },
    {
      "s": 296.28,
      "e": 299.08,
      "text": "We are a search and rescue squadron,"
    },
    {
      "s": 299.08,
      "e": 304.84,
      "text": "and in the future we will also be deployed outside Italy"
    },
    {
      "s": 304.84,
      "e": 308.08,
      "text": "to help our pilots in case of emergency."
    },
    {
      "s": 308.64,
      "e": 314.2,
      "text": "At the moment, we have an helicopter in the airbase of Decee Momanu,"
    },
    {
      "s": 314.2,
      "e": 319.04,
      "text": "in order to comply with the Italian juncture 2015 exercise."
    },
    {
      "s": 319.04,
      "e": 322.44,
      "text": "During the 2015 Turret Juncture, not exercise,"
    },
    {
      "s": 322.44,
      "e": 326.64,
      "text": "we have one of our helicopters deployed in Decee Momanu in Sardinia."
    },
    {
      "s": 326.64,
      "e": 333.08,
      "text": "Our job over there is to perform joint operation with the Slovenian personnel."
    },
    {
      "s": 333.08,
      "e": 336.4,
      "text": "Our job is basically saving human lives."
    },
    {
      "s": 336.4,
      "e": 340.0,
      "text": "We have the privilege of saving human lives, and we love it."
    }
  ],
